criteria:
Inclusion criteria:
Initial cancer diagnosis at least five years ago;
Age between 18 and 39 years at the time of initial cancer diagnosis;
Adequate written and spoken German language skills;
Electronic informed consent to participate in the study;
Internet access and access to a (mobile) device to complete the study questionnaire
Exclusion criteria:
Patients currently undergoing active cancer treatment (chemotherapy, radiotherapy, stem cell transplantation or immunotherapy)
